 be in your place.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253800/extras/6872aa26dfb717f5553e53d402e99180.poster.avif?t=1743788275\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253800/extras/6872aa26dfb717f5553e53d402e99180.webm?t=1743788275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253800/extras/6872aa26dfb717f5553e53d402e99180.mp4?t=1743788275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Manage subordinates and, above all, take care of the family.  Give them high positions and secure their future.<br><br><strong>There is unlimited power in your hands, you are God's representative on Earth.</strong>",
